---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { cta } from '@config/site';

const company = 'Meticulous';
const slug = 'meticulous-brief-fed5761c';
const deckHref = `/deliveries/${slug}/Evidence_Axis_Meticulous_Executive_Brief.pdf`;
const appendixHref = `/deliveries/${slug}/appendix.pdf`;
---

<Base
  title="Meticulous — Private Intelligence Brief"
  description="Private Evidence Axis intelligence delivery prepared for Meticulous."
  path={`/intelligence/${slug}/`}
  noindex={true}
>
  <main
    class="gift16"
    data-delivery-tracking
    data-delivery-company={company}
    data-delivery-slug={slug}
  >
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">PRIVATE EVIDENCE AXIS DELIVERY</p>
        <h1>Meticulous</h1>
        <p class="recipient">Prepared for Gabriel Spencer-Harper · CEO & Co-Founder</p>
        <p class="lede">A public-evidence brief on the boundary between session-derived verification and agent-generated coverage — and the category distinction Meticulous may want buyers to notice first.</p>

        <div class="file-actions" aria-label="Intelligence files">
          <a class="file-button deck" href={deckHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-delivery-event="executive-deck-opened">
            <span class="num">01</span>
            <span class="copy"><small>EXECUTIVE VIEW</small><strong>Open Executive Brief</strong><em>PDF ↗</em></span>
          </a>
          <a class="file-button appendix" href={appendixHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-delivery-event="evidence-appendix-opened">
            <span class="num">02</span>
            <span class="copy"><small>EVIDENCE VIEW</small><strong>Open Evidence Appendix</strong><em>PDF ↗</em></span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="hint">Open the Executive Brief first. The Appendix contains the source register, claim classifications, comparison boundaries, limitations and wording guardrails.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="finding">
      <div class="wrap narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow dark">ONE FINDING TO START WITH</p>
        <blockquote>“Agentic QA” now compresses materially different ways of creating test coverage into one reference class.</blockquote>
        <p>Across the comparison set reviewed, Meticulous starts from observed user/developer sessions; Momentic starts primarily from explicitly authored flows; QA Wolf from autonomous mapping and test intent; and Shiplight from coding-agent verification inside the development workflow. Agent involvement is converging. The origin of coverage remains a clearer distinction.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="read">
      <div class="wrap read-grid">
        <div><p class="eyebrow dark">HOW TO READ THE WORK</p><h2>Separate what the sources say from what the synthesis implies.</h2></div>
        <div class="states">
          <div><b>FACT</b><span>Directly supported by an opened and checked source.</span></div>
          <div><b>ATTRIBUTED CLAIM</b><span>A company or source claim kept explicitly attributed.</span></div>
          <div><b>INFERENCE</b><span>An analytical conclusion built from disclosed evidence.</span></div>
          <div><b>UNKNOWN</b><span>The reviewed public evidence does not establish a stronger conclusion.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="next">
      <div class="wrap narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow dark">IF THIS RAISES A REAL DECISION</p>
        <h2>Test the category frame before the Beta becomes the default buyer story.</h2>
        <p>The public brief stops at what can be established from outside. A paid decision sprint can add live win/loss evidence, buyer objections, deal-stage comparisons and internal roadmap priorities to decide which positioning frame creates the strongest buyer preference as agent-generated coverage expands.</p>
        <a class="cta" href={`${cta.secondary.href}&company=${encodeURIComponent(company)}`} data-delivery-event="decision-conversation-clicked">Discuss a Competitive Decision →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .gift16{background:#f5f2ea;color:#0b1518}
  .wrap{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto}
  .narrow{max-width:900px}
  .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:clamp(5.5rem,9vw,8.5rem) 0 4.5rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 12%,rgba(93,231,172,.14),transparent 31%),radial-gradient(circle at 50% 100%,rgba(245,164,62,.09),transparent 38%),#06110f;color:#f7fbf8}
  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:960px;text-align:center}
  .eyebrow{margin:0;font:700 .68rem/1.2 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.16em;color:#66e6b2}
  .eyebrow.dark{color:#28745d}
  .hero h1{margin:1rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(4.6rem,10vw,8.8rem);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.06em;color:#fff;text-wrap:balance;text-shadow:0 14px 46px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
  .recipient{margin:1.25rem 0 0;color:#bdd0ca;font:650 .74rem/1.45 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.055em}
  .lede{max-width:790px;margin:1.35rem auto 0;color:#dbe7e2;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.55vw,1.16rem);line-height:1.65;text-wrap:balance}
  .file-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.9rem;width:min(820px,100%);margin:2.65rem auto 0;text-align:left}
  .file-button{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:1.15rem;align-items:center;padding:1.35rem 1.45rem;border:1px solid rgba(102,230,178,.27);border-radius:1rem;text-decoration:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(12,35,30,.98),rgba(7,23,20,.98));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.26);transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease,background .2s ease}
  .file-button:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#66e6b2;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(16,45,38,.98),rgba(8,28,24,.98))}
  .file-button.appendix:hover{border-color:#f4ab55}
  .num{font:800 2rem/1 var(--font-mono);color:#66e6b2}
  .appendix .num{color:#f4ab55}
  .copy{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.3rem .75rem;align-items:end}
  .copy small{grid-column:1/-1;font:700 .58rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#91aaa2}
  .copy strong{font-size:clamp(1.02rem,2vw,1.2rem);line-height:1.2}
  .copy em{font-style:normal;color:#66e6b2;font:700 .68rem/1 var(--font-mono);white-space:nowrap}
  .appendix .copy em{color:#f4ab55}
  .hint{max-width:760px;margin:1.15rem auto 0;color:#829a92;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55}
  .finding,.read,.next{padding:clamp(4rem,7vw,6rem) 0}
  .finding{background:#ebe6dc}
  .finding blockquote{margin:1rem 0;font:750 clamp(2rem,4vw,3.8rem)/1.06 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.045em}
  .finding p:last-child,.next p{color:#5c6c68;line-height:1.7}
  .read{background:#fff}
  .read-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:4rem;align-items:center}
  .read h2,.next h2{margin:.7rem 0;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.04em}
  .states{display:grid;gap:.75rem}
  .states div{display:grid;gap:.35rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #d9e2de;border-radius:.8rem}
  .states b{font:800 .7rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:#28745d}
  .states span{color:#5c6c68}
  .next{background:#f5f2ea}
  .cta{display:inline-flex;margin-top:1rem;padding:.9rem 1.15rem;border-radius:.7rem;background:#0b1714;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750}
  @media(max-width:760px){
    .read-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}
    .hero{padding-top:4.75rem}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.8rem,18vw,5.7rem)}
    .recipient{font-size:.68rem}
    .file-button{padding:1.15rem 1.1rem;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr}
    .num{font-size:1.65rem}
    .copy{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
</style>
